dataFragment.data:
They part hands.
Ted Haggard's +1: You are lucky that your intentions are face-value, otherwise I would have screamed rape and stomped on the curb. That reminds me.
{Ted Haggard's +1 grabs Tim Lahaye's hands and does not let go until  . . . he doesn't know when, but hopes to know when he finds it.}

 Talk a ton! Hide and stay unknown! It's all part of the game!
Final thoughts? Okay! A message that connects and reflects cyberspace and our shared goals to build a cohesive and vibrant community, united by language and wit! Ah! I cannot say what mysteries and ciphers to unlock next.
One will hear or learn;
Trap to capture? Too currier duvey is the word that rules the norm;
Or how about the "heebie jebs?"

